    "status",
    "description",
    "capacityTonnes",
    "storedTonnes",
    "lotCount",
    "fillPct",
    "mixedUnits"
  ],
  "additionalProperties": {},
  "description": "A grain bin — a BIN/STORAGE Location with a computed fill. storedTonnes is the bin's HARVESTED_PRODUCE stock converted into tonnes via each lot's unit, so it is comparable to capacityTonnes; fillPct is the fraction of capacity used. Stock in a unit with no tonnage (COUNT/VOLUME) is reported in \`unconvertible\` and sets \`mixedUnits\`, which suppresses fillPct rather than being counted at face value."
}"
`;

